      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As an additional comment.\nBack then when I made that post you could only put I think 25 people in one favorite group. But since I had more than 25 friends which I regularly join, I had to split them in different groups. Now I always had to cycle thru all 3 groups to see who from all my favorite friends are online.\nBecause you can now put 150 people in one group it isn't that big of a problem any more, but I think it would still be neat to have.",
